    "travelFalsifier": "WITHDRAWN. The \"in-place and travelling differ by only 0.04 m\" falsifier was the same non-contiguity artifact. On contiguous stance they differ by 1.55x (Foot.L 2.1617 vs 1.3959 m) and 2.43x (Foot.R 1.5916 vs 0.6561 m).",
